OL,3,AManchester's Co-op Live evacuated after
OL,4,A'unknown substance' let off in crowd   
OL,6,FThousands of people were evacuated from
OL,7,Fa concert in Manchester on Sunday night
OL,8,Fafter an "unknown substance" was       
OL,9,Freleased into the crowd, police said.  
OL,11,FThe incident happened towards the end  
OL,12,Fof US rapper Don Toliver's show at the 
OL,13,FCo-op Live arena at about 22:00.       
OL,15,FThe North West Ambulance Service said  
OL,16,Fone person was taken to hospital for   
OL,17,Ffurther assessment while more than 50  
OL,18,Fpeople were assessed for "eye and      
OL,19,Frespiratory symptoms".                 
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
