OL,3,ABurnham to tell MPs 'landmark' EU deal 
OL,4,Acould make next decade 'much better'   
OL,6,FThe prime minister will tell Parliament
OL,7,Fon Monday the "landmark" deal struck   
OL,8,Fwith the EU means there is a "very real
OL,9,Fprospect" the next decade can be "much 
OL,10,Fbetter" than the last one.             
OL,12,FThe deal, which covers British food    
OL,13,Fexports, emissions trading and a youth 
OL,14,Fexperience scheme, is a "choice between
OL,15,Fa broken status quo or change", Andy   
OL,16,FBurnham will tell MPs.                 
OL,18,FHe will also call it "the single       
OL,19,Fbiggest growth measure to be delivered 
OL,20,Fin this parliament" - repeating his    
OL,21,Fclaim it could add #17bn to the British
OL,22,Feconomy.                               
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
