OL,3,ABurnham to tell MPs 'landmark' EU deal 
OL,4,Acould make next decade 'much better'   
OL,6,FBut opposition parties have criticised 
OL,7,Fthe plan, with the Conservatives       
OL,8,Fbranding it unfair as UK farmers would 
OL,9,Fhave to follow rules made by Brussels. 
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
